WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.606
Head of Selections:
check the draft team.

00:00:05.606 --> 00:00:09.873
Open a slot to compare
players and availability.

00:00:09.873 --> 00:00:13.983
Choose an available player.
The draft saves immediately.

00:00:13.983 --> 00:00:20.761
Send the draft to
linked captains for their input.

00:00:20.761 --> 00:00:27.371
Captain Checks keeps
the draft conversation together.

00:00:27.371 --> 00:00:33.383
Selectors can add a note.

00:00:33.383 --> 00:00:40.269
Head of Selections
makes the final decision.

00:00:40.269 --> 00:00:44.544
Publish when the team is ready.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.817
Players can now see the team
and match details.
